,"playId":"401871066292","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7857,"playId":"401871066297","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7807,"playId":"401871066301","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.771,"playId":"401871066305","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7683,"playId":"401871066309","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7636,"playId":"401871066314","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7818,"playId":"401871066317","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7918,"playId":"401871066321","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7878,"playId":"401871066324","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7747,"playId":"401871066329","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7634,"playId":"401871066333","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.7562,"playId":"401871066339","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.811,"playId":"401871066344","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.813,"playId":"401871066351","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.8395,"playId":"401871066355","tiePercentage":0}],"gameInfo":{"venue":{"id":"2031","guid":"4063a5ea-b6c4-3f2f-af51-b4678bada317","fullName":"Pitbull Stadium","address":{"city":"Miami","state":"FL","zipCode":"33199","country":"USA"},"grass":true,"images":[]},"attendance":10013},"article":{"headline":"Robert Czeremcha makes career-high 5 field goals as FIU beats New Mexico State 22-3","description":"— Robert Czeremcha made a career-high five field goals to tie a program record and Florida International beat New Mexico State 22-3 on Wednesday night.","story":"MIAMI -- — <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5230751/robert-czeremcha\" target=\"_new\">Robert Czeremcha</a> made a career-high five field goals to tie a program record and Florida International beat New Mexico State 22-3 on Wednesday night.\n\n\r\n              Czeremcha had makes of 40, 52, 33, 21 and 48 — after entering with a career-long of 39 set last year. Czeremcha tied Dustin Rivest's single-game record set against Arkansas State in 2008. \n\n\r\n              <a href=\"https://x.com/FIUFootball/status/2108017290302419223\">Czeremcha's 52-yarder came on FIU's opening drive of the second half</a> for a 13-3 lead. His final make from 48-yards out was set up by <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4682504/demetrius-hill\" target=\"_new\">Demetrius Hill</a>'s interception — FIU's third takeaway of the game. \n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4870883/jj-kohl\" target=\"_new\">JJ Kohl</a> was 12 of 21 for 115 yards with an interception for FIU (3-2, 1-0 Conference USA), which has won five straight home games dating to last season. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5146722/devonte-lyons\" target=\"_new\">Devonte Lyons</a> rushed for 78 yards on 14 carries and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079372/anthony-carrie\" target=\"_new\">Anthony Carrie</a> had a touchdown on the ground.\n\n\r\n              Starter <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5152503/adam-damante\" target=\"_new\">Adam Damante</a> and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5224084/trey-hedden\" target=\"_new\">Trey Hedden</a>, who started the first four games of the season, each threw an interception for New Mexico State (2-4, 1-1). <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5220253/james-jones\" target=\"_new\">James Jones</a>, who entered leading CUSA in rushing yards per game at 102.0, had 89 yards on the ground. \n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              New Mexico State: At Sam Houston on Oct. 21. \n\n\r\n              FIU: At Jacksonville State on Tuesday. \n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"https://apnews.com/newsletters\">Sign up for Top 25 poll alerts here</a>, visit <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/ap-top-25-college-football-poll\">the Top 25 here</a> and see AP’s full <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/college-football\">college football coverage here</a>","published":"2026-10-08T03:47:40Z"}}